  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 1811.679,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "so Shinszen Young alluded to this in the",
    "start": 1815.039,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "sit um was in a sweat lodge with uh uh",
