    "start": 1943.039,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "of I don't have that.",
    "start": 1946.799,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "But he made patients look so good. And",
    "start": 1950.96,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "he made my frenzy look so absurd,",
    "start": 1953.6,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
