    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, just like all the frenzy just",
    "start": 1966.96,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "in the light of that. It's like okay.",
    "start": 1969.919,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "It's almost the nervous system being",
    "start": 1973.279,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "entrained by the model of another",
    "start": 1975.2,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "patience.",
