    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "peak porami",
    "start": 1985.519,
    "duration": 6.241
  },
  {
    "text": "but foundational.",
    "start": 1988.559,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 1991.76,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha said to comprehend duka,",
    "start": 1994.72,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "comprehend suffering that takes",
    "start": 1997.2,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "patience. patience.",
    "start": 1999.12,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Ordinarily,",
    "start": 2002.88,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "even very modest amounts of suffering",
    "start": 2005.2,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "set off many alarm bells in our system.",
    "start": 2008.48,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "And it rallies all of this urgency. It",
    "start": 2011.919,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "rallies all of this non-patience",
    "start": 2014.799,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "suffering",
    "start": 2018.72,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "sort of startling and unbelievable, you",
    "start": 2021.039,
    "duration": 4.721
  },
  {
    "text": "know,",
    "start": 2024.159,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "and to be patient with the complexities",
