    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "order on our problems.",
    "start": 2060.48,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "But when we do that, it it's almost",
    "start": 2064.24,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "always a naive framework, you know, when",
    "start": 2067.599,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "we kind of slot in our problems to the",
    "start": 2071.04,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Buddhist concepts",
    "start": 2074.72,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh tell a kind of try to tell that",
    "start": 2077.28,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "dharma story.",
    "start": 2080.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "There's almost some naivee in it.",
    "start": 2083.2,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "And we have to be",
    "start": 2086.96,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
