    "text": "patient",
    "start": 2089.919,
    "duration": 4.401
  },
  {
    "text": "and receptive",
    "start": 2091.839,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "to suffering",
    "start": 2094.32,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "before slotting it into conceptual",
    "start": 2096.399,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "categories.",
    "start": 2099.68,
    "duration": 8.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Takes patience just to receive that.",
    "start": 2102.56,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Let me not sort out my life. this pain,",
    "start": 2108.4,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "this ailment, this ache in my heart,",
    "start": 2112.4,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "this, you know, let me not sort it all",
    "start": 2115.2,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "out into this new Buddhist framework,",
    "start": 2117.2,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "but just let me",
    "start": 2120.16,
    "duration": 6.919
  },
  {
    "text": "be patient and receive",
    "start": 2122.72,
    "duration": 4.359
  },
  {
    "text": "to be patient with our path.",
    "start": 2128.96,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "So many problems arise out of this kind",
    "start": 2132.72,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "of very this demand on like very",
    "start": 2135.839,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "shortterm return on investment",
    "start": 2140.16,
    "duration": 6.679
  },
  {
    "text": "mind states",
    "start": 2143.44,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2146.88,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "it's true sometimes dharma relief is",
    "start": 2150.56,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "instantaneous you know just just one",
    "start": 2153.359,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "mindful breath or a few moments of",
    "start": 2157.839,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness can change so much. We often",
    "start": 2161.68,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "feel like, oh, samadei stillness is so",
    "start": 2165.359,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "far away. But it's sometimes it's like",
    "start": 2168.56,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "just a few breaths",
    "start": 2171.2,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and something shifts. That's real.",
    "start": 2174.16,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "But generally speaking, it is a gradual",
    "start": 2179.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "cultivation and we cannot discern the",
    "start": 2182.079,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness that is acrewing. The goodness",
    "start": 2185.52,
    "duration": 8.76
  },
  {
    "text": "acres beneath the radar of awareness.",
    "start": 2189.119,
    "duration": 5.161
  },
  {
    "text": "We have to be patient.",
    "start": 2194.56,
    "duration": 3.799
  },
  {
    "text": "Ajin Sajjito says u",
    "start": 2200.0,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "says the the Buddha famously dis",
    "start": 2203.44,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "declared uh ki patience to be the",
    "start": 2206.48,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "supreme",
    "start": 2208.88,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "purification practice. He pointed not to",
    "start": 2210.72,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "physical aestheticism, which he",
    "start": 2213.2,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "frequently spoke against, but to the",
    "start": 2215.44,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "restraint of holding the heart still in",
    "start": 2217.44,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "the presence of its suffering",
    "start": 2221.68,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "until it lets go of the ways in which it",
    "start": 2226.0,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "creates suffering.",
    "start": 2228.16,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "All the parameies contribute to the",
    "start": 2230.48,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "lessening and dismantling of that duka.",
    "start": 2232.24,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But the specific quality of patience is",
    "start": 2234.96,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "to carry the heart through the",
    "start": 2238.24,
    "duration": 3.839
  },
  {
    "text": "turbulence",
    "start": 2240.079,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "of existence so that it no longer",
    "start": 2242.079,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "shakes, sinks",
    "start": 2245.839,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "or lashes out.",
    "start": 2248.8,
    "duration": 3.799
  },
  {
    "text": "Holding the heart still",
    "start": 2254.48,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "in the presence of its suffering. That's",
    "start": 2258.0,
    "duration": 8.079
  },
  {
    "text": "the the part of me of patience.",
    "start": 2261.76,
    "duration": 4.319
  },
  {
    "text": "Practice is about um about states and",
    "start": 2268.24,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "traits.",
    "start": 2273.839,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "But you know momentary state of",
    "start": 2275.68,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness and the trait of",
    "start": 2279.2,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness, the dispositional quality",
    "start": 2280.96,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of set point of mindfulness or",
    "start": 2284.56,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "whatever.",
    "start": 2287.2,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "And generally speaking, states are",
    "start": 2289.28,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "valued in so far as they translate and",
    "start": 2291.76,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "harden into traits.",
    "start": 2295.68,
    "duration": 4.2
  },
  {
    "text": "And when we enter practice, a lot of",
    "start": 2300.72,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "times there's some kind of fetish about",
    "start": 2303.04,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "bliss or peace or, you know, like I'm",
    "start": 2307.04,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "going to get this, you know, and it's",
    "start": 2309.44,
    "duration": 3.919
  },
  {
    "text": "like, okay, this is not a state-based",
    "start": 2310.88,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "practice.",
    "start": 2313.359,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "No, no kind of",
    "start": 2315.839,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "Gold stars. Exactly. For states.",
    "start": 2319.44,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Yeah. There are moments of clarity or",
    "start": 2323.68,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "insight or love or ecstasy, bliss,",
    "start": 2325.839,
    "duration": 6.481
  },
  {
    "text": "whatever. Not dismissive of that, but",
    "start": 2328.4,
    "duration": 8.76
  },
  {
    "text": "they become kind of not a big deal.",
    "start": 2332.32,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "They",
    "start": 2337.28,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "are valued in so far as they they",
    "start": 2339.52,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "develop into traits. And traits do not",
    "start": 2343.44,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "require effort to be maintained. This",
    "start": 2346.72,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of sense of I have to be mindful. I",
    "start": 2350.96,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "have to remember mindfulness. I have to",
    "start": 2353.2,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "remember mindfulness.",
    "start": 2354.88,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Am I being mindful? Am I being reactive",
    "start": 2356.88,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "or responsive? It's too much. It's too",
    "start": 2359.76,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "much. We're going to have to entrust",
    "start": 2363.44,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "oursel to our good habits,",
    "start": 2366.24,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "right?",
    "start": 2370.0,
    "duration": 3.599
  },
  {
    "text": "We can't. How do we remember when we're",
    "start": 2371.599,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "forgetting?",
    "start": 2373.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We entrust our life to good habits.",
    "start": 2376.72,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And we have to be patient. Patient as",
    "start": 2382.4,
    "duration": 9.32
  },
  {
    "text": "states harden into traits.",
    "start": 2386.88,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "We have to be patient.",
    "start": 2392.88,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "could say as we come to love new things,",
    "start": 2395.52,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the dharma is about loving what we've",
    "start": 2399.92,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "always loved, remembering that love,",
    "start": 2402.16,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "refinding it, and it's also about coming",
    "start": 2404.8,
    "duration": 9.559
  },
  {
    "text": "to love new things. That takes patience.",
    "start": 2408.32,
    "duration": 6.039
  },
  {
    "text": "When someone says,",
    "start": 2414.64,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I I want to meditate each day, but I",
    "start": 2418.32,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "can't.",
    "start": 2421.04,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "what they're asking really in the end",
    "start": 2422.56,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and why there's no simple answer.",
    "start": 2425.92,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "What they're asking is how do I love",
    "start": 2429.44,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "something new?",
    "start": 2431.44,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "When someone asks, \"How do I stop",
    "start": 2436.4,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "hating myself all the self harshness?\"",
    "start": 2440.64,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "They're asking how do I love something",
    "start": 2444.8,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "new?",
    "start": 2447.04,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And when we make uh an intention or a",
    "start": 2450.96,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "New Year's resolution or something,",
    "start": 2454.32,
    "duration": 8.36
  },
  {
    "text": "we're trying to value something new.",
    "start": 2457.68,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But to love something new is not a",
    "start": 2463.52,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "simple thing. We",
    "start": 2465.599,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "know, you know, we cannot force",
    "start": 2467.92,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves to fall in love.",
    "start": 2471.359,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "That's not a kind of um decision that we",
    "start": 2475.2,
    "duration": 8.639
  },
  {
    "text": "we make. It's not a simple in moment of",
    "start": 2479.599,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "choice.",
    "start": 2483.839,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "What we value, what we come to love, it",
    "start": 2486.0,
    "duration": 7.119
  },
  {
    "text": "grows over time through patience,",
    "start": 2488.96,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "through small gestures",
    "start": 2493.119,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "of commitment.",
    "start": 2495.76,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "So like this from Agnes Kellard can all",
    "start": 2501.04,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "think back to a time where when we're",
    "start": 2505.76,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "substantially different people valuewise",
    "start": 2507.599,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "from the people we are now. We care",
    "start": 2510.4,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "about things we once did not care about.",
    "start": 2513.68,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "How did this change come about?",
    "start": 2517.04,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "The transition from indifference to love",
    "start": 2520.16,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "cannot typically be affected",
    "start": 2522.56,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "by way of doing any one thing. No matter",
    "start": 2525.359,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "the strength of my will, it does not",
    "start": 2528.72,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "seem that I can muscle myself into",
    "start": 2530.72,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "suddenly caring.",
    "start": 2533.92,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "To be sure, the path to valuing",
    "start": 2536.079,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "something sometimes includes momentary",
    "start": 2538.079,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "expressions of commitment. The moment",
    "start": 2540.319,
    "duration": 6.481
  },
  {
    "text": "when you say, \"I do.\" Sign the adoption",
    "start": 2543.119,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "papers or buy the one-way plane ticket",
    "start": 2546.8,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "to a foreign country.",
    "start": 2550.079,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "But these moments are themselves only",
    "start": 2553.119,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "part of the story, punctuating a longer",
    "start": 2555.04,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "process.",
    "start": 2557.599,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "Coming to value something tends to",
    "start": 2559.68,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "represent a deep change in how one sees",
    "start": 2562.56,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and feels and thinks.",
    "start": 2565.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Acquiring a new value alters the",
    "start": 2569.04,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "structure of one's priorities",
    "start": 2571.52,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "by demoting or even displacing something",
    "start": 2574.24,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "one valued before.",
    "start": 2576.72,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Such changes take time over the course",
    "start": 2579.2,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "of which one has done many different",
    "start": 2581.68,
    "duration": 3.6
  },
  {
    "text": "things",
    "start": 2583.76,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "in service of value appreciation.",
    "start": 2585.28,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "The latter actions",
    "start": 2589.52,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "are sh the later actions are shaped by",
    "start": 2591.68,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "the small changes that the earlier ones",
    "start": 2595.2,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "have engendered in such a way as to",
    "start": 2598.319,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "allow someone to slowly develop new",
    "start": 2601.119,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "priorities,",
    "start": 2603.839,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "concerns and attachments.",
    "start": 2605.68,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "The process as a whole is not structured",
    "start": 2608.8,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "as a single moment of intention or",
    "start": 2612.079,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "decision",
    "start": 2615.44,
    "duration": 5.159
  },
  {
    "text": "at its inception.",
    "start": 2617.04,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "The patience of coming to love new",
    "start": 2623.2,
    "duration": 5.879
  },
  {
    "text": "things.",
    "start": 2626.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Coming to love the simplicity of letting",
    "start": 2630.16,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "go rather than the complication of",
    "start": 2633.599,
    "duration": 5.401
  },
  {
    "text": "clinging.",
    "start": 2636.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "That's not a decision we make.",
    "start": 2641.359,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "We make small gestures as in service of",
    "start": 2647.2,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "value, appreciation, of valuing",
    "start": 2651.599,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "something new, of coming to love",
    "start": 2654.96,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "something new. We sit quietly. We",
    "start": 2657.68,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "sign on to YouTube.",
    "start": 2662.319,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "We go to a group. We reflect on",
    "start": 2664.96,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness. We sit down each day. We have",
    "start": 2667.2,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "a conscious moment of suffering, of",
    "start": 2670.64,
    "duration": 5.719
  },
  {
    "text": "willingness.",
    "start": 2673.359,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And then",
    "start": 2680.48,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "we plant these seeds. It doesn't seem",
    "start": 2682.64,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "like a big deal. Keep planting.",
    "start": 2685.2,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Who knows what led to what?",
    "start": 2689.28,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "But at some point,",
    "start": 2692.56,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "there's some clarity. Okay.",
    "start": 2695.839,
    "duration": 9.24
  },
  {
    "text": "I've lived my way into a dharma life.",
    "start": 2699.839,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Offer this for your consideration.",
    "start": 2707.119,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "Wish you uh wish you well. May we uh",
    "start": 2710.8,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "may we be uh patient with uh our hearts",
    "start": 2715.04,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "and those of others today.",
    "start": 2718.64,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2721.359,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "I'll try to do that too. Let's all keep",
    "start": 2724.0,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "each other honest. Okay.",
    "start": 2726.72,
    "duration": 8.359
  },
  {
    "text": "All right. See you uh see you tomorrow.",
    "start": 2730.48,
    "duration": 4.599
  }
]